  "_comment": "Template for /opt/labs-control-panel/service-credentials.json (chmod 600, git-ignored). Per-slug learner-service connection settings for labsctl service engine. Omit a slug or the whole file to fall back to legacy 127.0.0.1 all-in-one behaviour.",
